		{"id":"memoir_00","type":"text","text":"# ⓪ L0: RAW\n### 📜 原始对话/碎碎念\n---\n**存储**: `100_Inbox_Intelligence/`\n**状态**: 只读追加\n**职能**: 原始灵魂素材\n**Owner**: **小憶 (XiaoYi)**","x":-800,"y":-580,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"#FFD700"},
		{"id":"ssot_file","type":"text","text":"# 🟪 SSOT (紫色资产)\n---\n**路径**: `000_Cabinet_System/`\n**文件**: `Kenny_Cognitive_Profile.md`\n**状态**: 已封印真值 (Static Baseline)","x":480,"y":-580,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"#8A2BE2"},
		{"id":"openbt_layer","type":"text","text":"# ⛓️ OpenBT (分布式底座)\n---\n**管理官**: 小欧 (Guardian)\n**任务**: \n1. RAW 数据加密分片下沉\n2. 跨节点数据自愈","x":480,"y":100,"width":380,"height":275,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"xiaoyi_l2","type":"text","text":"# 🧪 L2: 跨度炼化\n---\n**任务**: 一致性对齐，锁定画像变量\n**输入**: 10条以上 L1 小结\n**输出**: 画像 Patch 提案","x":-800,"y":125,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"#FFD700"},
		{"id":"n4_gap","type":"text","text":"# 🧠 Gap Engine (结构补全)\n---\n**逻辑**: 不做决策，只做结构师\n1. **识别缺口**: (技术/商业/用户)\n2. **标记偏差**: 检测违背 [本地优先] 处\n3. **提供选项**: 补全建议 A/B/C","x":-250,"y":125,"width":550,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"qdrant_db","type":"text","text":"# 🧬 Qdrant (向量库)\n---\n**属性**: 动态感应层 / 长期记忆\n**存储**: Payload {Metadata, Ref_ID}\n**检索**: 语义相似度召回","x":480,"y":-300,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n3_ku","type":"text","text":"# 🏗️ 小酷 (CTO/Architect)\n---\n**职责**: 系统执行与工作流搭建\n**启动前置**: 执行 [混合检索]\n1. 读取物理 SSOT 文件\n2. Query Qdrant 向量背景","x":-250,"y":-580,"width":550,"height":220,"color":"1"},
